# IDE / tooling
.vs/
*.user

# Claude Code agent worktrees — ephemeral, created and torn down per background
# agent, never meant to be committed.
.claude/worktrees/

# Ledger's launcher icon is generated, not committed — unlike the other apps',
# whose IconStudio output is checked in. Ledger's CI build regenerates it before
# packaging (see CLAUDE.md), so the console's output here is build output. Listed
# explicitly rather than as Resources/** because Resources/Styles is real source.
Ledger/Ledger.Android/Resources/drawable/
Ledger/Ledger.Android/Resources/drawable-nodpi/
Ledger/Ledger.Android/Resources/mipmap-*/
Ledger/Ledger.Android/Resources/values/
